"[actor] [page stabilization] exit start delay early on first paint" (crbugs
580001415 and 573290593, not public): when a contentful paint happens during
the page stability monitor's start delay, monitoring starts at once. Not a
security fix as far as the change shows, but it is on the 157 branch, which
the bleeding-edge build carries in full. chromium/src main commit
8abd4d875d004eccfbeb3298892851f481236f12 (main@{#1720956}), merged on
2026-11-04 to the 157 branch (185187f8924db3fd2d29131464be9e1280dc231b,
refs/branch-heads/8103@{#1121}, after the 157.0.8103.45 tag). This is the
157 merge without its browser test (the components/BUILD.gn dependency it
adds is kept). Drop it once a 157 tag has it.

